    - Navigate to showcase page, verify issue is reproducible there
  - If backend-only: Check logs, API, or relevant interface
  - (purpose: understand real problem in its actual context)
- **CHECK CODE**: Read relevant code files (purpose: understand current implementation)
- **PLAN**: Document what needs fixing (purpose: create clear solution plan)
